.TH "LEAN" "1" "Oct 2026" "lean" "lean Manual"

.SH NAME
lean-config-init - Create a local or global configuration

.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlean config init [flags]\fP

.SH DESCRIPTION
Create project-local or user-global configuration interactively.

Without --global, writes .lean/lean.toml and configures project settings. With --global, writes ~/.lean/config.toml and configures user-level editor and secret storage settings.

.SH OPTIONS
\fB-g\fP, \fB--global\fP[=false]
	Create global configuration

\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for init

.SH SEE ALSO
\fBlean-config(1)\fP

.SH HISTORY
2-Oct-2026 Updated for split local/global configuration
